msgid "Replace mode and backups"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-in-synced.php:656
msgid "Replace mode clears (TRUNCATEs) the selected tables on the receiver before importing. The receiver writes a SQL backup under wp-content/uploads/in-synced-backups/ first and aborts the push if the backup cannot be created. The newest 5 backups are kept and web access to the folder is blocked. Backups are a manual restore aid, not an automated rollback."
msgstr ""

